-+# UI Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-100 (KB-P3-08)
-+
-+- Auditor: ui-specialist (Swarm UI & UX Architecture Specialist Gate)
-+- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-100`
