-+  * `include_hashes_true_200` (exposure of `prev_hash` and `row_hash` hex strings)
-+  * `cursor_tampered_422` (RFC 7807 `422 INVALID_CURSOR`)
-+  * `non_viewer_404` (indistinguishable 404 response)
